OL,3,GNEWSAOlympian Ciara Mageean marries
OL,4,Along-term partner
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlympian Ciara Mageean has wed her
OL,7,Flong-term partner Thomas Moran in a
OL,8,Fsmall civil ceremony in Belfast.
OL,10,FThe athlete, who was diagnosed with
OL,11,Fstage four bowel cancer in May 2025,
OL,12,Fposted a number of pictures on her
OL,13,FInstagram account.
OL,15,FThe couple tied the knot on Monday, and
OL,16,Fthe photographs show the newlyweds at
OL,17,Fvarious landmarks around the city,
OL,18,Fincluding Belfast City Hall, the
OL,19,FTitanic Docks and the Cathedral
OL,20,FQuarter's umbrellas.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
